      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "While a QvPen is held in hand, other QvPen world pickups, spawned inventory items and personal mirrors are not picked up. These behave correctly, this is the expected behavior.\n\nPrints are an exception to this, they get selected in Build `1921` (incorrectly) with a QvPen in hand where the other previously listed UI elements do not.\n\nSee the attached demonstration video with a print, a QvPen, an item (Winter Cheerizer), and a personal mirror.",
